        # A stable array must not have more than 'limit' consecutive 0s or 1s.

        # Let dp0[i][j] be the number of stable arrays with i zeros and j ones ending in 0.
        # To avoid more than 'limit' consecutive 0s, the last block of 0s must have length <= limit.
